<title>UK: London coal/ore fixtures.</title>
<headline>London coal/ore fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>COAL - Comanche - 120,000 tonnes coal Hampton Roads/Fos 25-30/11 $6.50 fio seven days shinc Cetragpa.</p>
<p>ORE - Cobelfret TBN - 140,000 tonnes ore Narvik/Rotterdam end Nov $2.85 fio six days shinc Rohstoffhandel.</p>
